# Airline Route Optimization Dashboard

An independent, standalone full-stack web dashboard showcasing multi-objective routing optimization (Fuel Burn vs. Passenger Density vs. Profit Yield margins) plotted via Leaflet.js maps.

## Local Setup Instructions

### Prerequisites
Make sure you have **Python 3.8+** installed on your operating system.

### 1. Fire up the Backend API Server
Open a fresh terminal window and run the following commands:

```bash
# Navigate to the project backend directory
cd airline-route-optimizer/backend

# Create a clean virtual environment
python -m venv venv

# Activate the virtual environment
# On macOS/Linux:
source venv/bin/activate
# On Windows Command Prompt:
# venv\Scripts\activate

# Install the dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Run the live Uvicorn backend server
uvicorn main:app --reload